units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p

pair_style lj/class2 9.0
pair_modify mix sixthpower
bond_style class2
angle_style class2
dihedral_style none
improper_style none
special_bonds lj/coul 0.0 0.0 1.0 angle no dihedral no
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check no

read_data system.data

pair_coeff 1 1 0.0 3.50
bond_coeff 1 1.42 200.0 -25.0 6.0
angle_coeff 1 109.5 35.0 -4.0 1.2
angle_coeff 1 bb 8.0 1.42 1.42
angle_coeff 1 ba 3.0 2.5 1.42 1.42

thermo_style custom step pe
run 0
